      Apache License 2.0
  * OkHttp (com.squareup.okhttp3:okhttp)
      Apache License 2.0
  * Shizuku API/Provider (dev.rikka.shizuku)
      Apache License 2.0
  * HiddenApiBypass (org.lsposed.hiddenapibypass)
      Apache License 2.0
  * BouncyCastle (org.bouncycastle:bcpkix-jdk18on, bcprov-jdk18on)
      Bouncy Castle Licence (MIT-style) -- https://www.bouncycastle.org/licence.html
  * Conscrypt (org.conscrypt:conscrypt-android)
      Apache License 2.0
  * SnakeYAML (org.yaml:snakeyaml)
      Apache License 2.0
