LiquidAI LEAP SDK -- proprietary
================================================================================

ClosePaw embeds `ai.liquid.leap:leap-sdk` (version 0.9.2) for on-device LLM
inference. The LEAP SDK is **not open source**. It is distributed under the
LiquidAI "Leap Terms of Use", a proprietary developer license:

    https://leap.liquid.ai/terms
    POM-declared license: "Leap Terms of Use"

Implications for downstream users of this repository:

  1. The LEAP SDK binary is fetched from Maven Central but cannot be
     redistributed under Apache 2.0; it remains governed by the LEAP terms.
  2. Anyone building or shipping ClosePaw inherits LiquidAI's terms with
     respect to the LEAP component. Review the linked terms before
     redistributing builds that include this dependency.
  3. To produce a fully Apache-2.0 distribution, remove the
     `ai.liquid.leap:leap-sdk` dependency in `app/build.gradle.kts` and the
     local-LLM backend code paths that depend on it.

